Think this may be a big bug :-)  I wander into a general store, and look
around and see a bag that would be useful, so I pick it up and get these
messages:

You owe Possogroenoe 35 zorkmids.--More--
You have a little trouble lifting Q - a bag.

Note, that it hasn't quoted me a price for the bag, and it's not something
I've previously dropped and not sold!  Odd thinks me, so I drop it:

You drop a bag.  Your debt is paid off.--More--
Possogroenoe offers 50 gold pieces for your bag.  Sell it? [ynaq] (y)

Hehe, doesn't take a genius to figure out what I answered, not surprising,
since I had 100 gp and I wanted other stuff in the shop that amounted to over
a 1000gp, didn't take me long :-) and I bought the bag, it had 35 gp in it and
nothing else.  I gotta see if putting my own gold in a bag that belongs to the
shop has a similar effect.
